    <string name="text_ayuda">Welcome to the MINESWEEPER game!</string>
    <string name="text_ayuda1">The game consists of clearing all the cells in a grid that do not hide a mine. Some cells contain a number.</string>
    <string name="text_ayuda2">This number indicates how many mines are in the surrounding cells. So, if a cell contains the number 3, it means that among the eight surrounding cells (if it is not on an edge or corner), 3 contain mines and 5 do not.</string>
    <string name="text_ayuda4">If you uncover a cell with a mine, YOU LOSE the game.</string>
    <string name="text_ayuda5">Otherwise, if you uncover all cells without mines, YOU WIN!!</string>
    <string name="text_ayuda6">You can configure the number of rows in the grid, the percentage of mines, and whether you want to set a maximum time to complete the game.</string>
